  "collectionNotes": [
    "真实客体LX6指令经SCCB寄存器配置传感器，LEDC经GPIO27提供XCLK；GPIO15硬件RESET、DVP GPIO矩阵与I2S0 DMA描述符共同决定客体DRAM中的RGB565/YUV422或外部编码JPEG字节。",
    "partial：数字相机子集使用约10Hz帧/1ms VSYNC近似调度，不模拟光学、曝光/ISP、JPEG编码器、逐PCLK时序、真实RF或电池/PoE模拟电气。未实机验证；出厂固件兼容性未由寄存器/DMA测试推断。",
    "JPEG必须由使用者提供与传感器SCCB配置尺寸一致的完整JPEG，按原字节进入客体；RGB图片不会冒充传感器编码JPEG，预览不会代替客体DMA输出。",
    "No physical device, factory firmware execution or calibrated1:1 photographic acceptance in this batch.",
    "Original photographs are M5Stack copyright, not relicensed under the repository MIT license.",
    "Geometry explicitly marked image-measurement is an exterior approximation; connector depths, internal board-space and hidden component dimensions are estimates.",
    "Official factory/UIFlow/Xiaozhi investigation is recorded separately; manufacturer identity and a model preview do not establish firmware compatibility.",
    "Loose wall/LEGO clips and translated print-layout duplicates are excluded; original selected shell assembly coordinates remain intact.",
    "Manufacturer caseCAD omits the optical lens and populatedPCB; lens dimensions/placement use photograph estimates, not a claim of native lensCAD.",
    "BM8563 RTC、定时唤醒、G33电源保持和电池模拟尚未实现；当前使用外部供电数字相机子集，不以GPIO动画模拟关机。",
    "OfficialSKU redirects fix exact identity; original current UTC/hash receipts retained.",
    "Geometry/runtime/factory-image acceptance are separate. Sourcephoto reconstruction plans retain all manual calibration and uncertainty."
  ]
